{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ab2b450d9cd22808","name":"Thud Bug","source":{"id":"source:reference-ab2b450d9cd22808","title":"Thud Bug","revision":20331,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:38:55Z","sha256":"88c153c47a9b6204eab251c2373838e9bb08febc592924f0f0bec367c572b7b7","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20331","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Thud%20Bug&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ab2b450d9cd22808","blocks":[{"tag":"h4","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Like ",{"tag":"a","children":["Razor Bugs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Razor_Bugs"},", Thud Bugs are insects engineered by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," to serve as ranged weapons. A thrown Thud Bug is treated as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapon (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapon_(Ranged)"},", not a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Thrown Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Thrown_Weapon"},", for purposes of determining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". Additionally, the wielder can choose to deal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage instead of normal damage against a target at Point-Blank or Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Web Enhancements"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Star Wars Miniatures Previews"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Star_Wars_Miniatures_Previews"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Thud Bugs (or ",{"tag":"i","children":["nang hul"]}," in Yuuzhan Vong) are nasty bioengineered weapons that fly toward an enemy at high speed when thrown. If the attack deals damage and the attack roll equals or exceeds a living target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},", the target is knocked ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"},". After hitting a target, the Thud Bug falls dormant (",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," 15, 1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Point"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," 10) until reset. Resetting a dormant Thud Bug so that it can be used again requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," and a DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Life Sciences)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Life_Sciences)"}," check for any other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If the ranged attack roll is less than the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", the Thud Bug returns to the attacker at the end of the turn. The attacker must use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to catch and reuse the Thud Bug; otherwise, the Thud Bug falls dormant in the attacker's square. If the target successfully uses the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]}," talent against an attack with a Thud Bug, the Thud Bug is destroyed.\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons_(Ranged)","referenceId":"reference:8456b42e685346fd"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Small (",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},") or Tiny (",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}]},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 800 (",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d8 (",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},") or 2d6 (",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}]},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Bludgeoning\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",